@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000
@userId = demo-user

### 健康检查
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 导入文档（Swagger 更适合选择本地文件）
POST {{baseUrl}}/documents
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="policy.md"
Content-Type: text/markdown

退款将在三个工作日内原路退回。
--boundary--

### 知识问答
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "退货后多久到账？",
  "user_id": "{{userId}}"
}

### 订单工具
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "查询订单 A1001",
  "user_id": "{{userId}}"
}

### 工单意图——先取得 confirmation_token
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "物流一直没有更新，请创建工单",
  "user_id": "{{userId}}"
}

### 确认创建工单——替换令牌
POST {{baseUrl}}/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "confirmation_token": "replace-with-token-from-chat",
  "user_id": "{{userId}}"
}

### 离线评测（先运行 python scripts/seed.py）
POST {{baseUrl}}/evaluations/run

